      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَلَائِثُ</span></b>  <i>People of the lower,</i> or <i>lowest, class.</i>
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ مِنْ هَلَائِثِهِمْ</span>, mentioned, but not
explained, by IAar: thought by ISd to signify
<i>He is of the dregs of them:</i> or, <i>of their assembly,</i>
or <i>company.</i> (TA.)

